{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Full employees:\n\nMatteo and Despo are a pair of mice. Matteo wears a lil thimble as a hat and brings a garnish sword around with him. While Despo wears a little red scarf and carries a needle. The two are best friends and rivals. They help in the cafe by leading people to seating areas. And may duel each other to entertain kids. (They are easily influenced by the kids who follow Sutri. And often get into mischief  trying to impress them.)\n\nWillow is a red panda. They have a collar of raven feathers, they often bring the tea trays to tables, and bus the tables after people have left. They are a recovering klepto and are trying have their heart in the right place, even if their nose isn't. \n\nFinally, Clementine the giant badger works in the kitchen helping to clean dishes and assist in baking. Stern and serious she often helps keep the peace among the volunteers when Eliot is busy with customers.","created_at":"2021-07-10T18:12:45.663000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863482898183487528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
