{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Luard grins, his fellow elf might be better at haggling than he first thought. \"Alright, alright. How about this. If we pull this off. We each take 400, then we give the 200 to whoever does the most work.\" He tilts his head to show one eye at Meorys and reaches out a hand. \"Deal?\" Luard figures he could charm this elf while working to get that 60:40 deal.","created_at":"2021-07-11T10:38:16.223000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863730909726507028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
